/T (In the fall of 2024, we reached out to the Raymond M. Alf Museum of Paleontology and started a collaboration project related to under water fossil excavations in Turlock Lake. Through extensive process of R&D we put together a manually controlled submarine that can perform under water mapping and fossil locating.)
/E (In the fall of 2024, we reached out to the Raymond M. Alf Museum of Paleontology and started a collaboration project related to under water fossil excavations in Turlock Lake. Through extensive process of R&D we put together a manually controlled submarine that can perform under water mapping and fossil locating.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 377 0 R
/E (The ROV is equipped with 8 thrusters, allowing 6-degree-of-freedom movement. It features a depth rating of up to 100 meters, supported by a 300-meter tether cable. The onboard HD camera provides real-time imagery with bright 1500 lumen LEDs for improved visibility. Navigation and control are managed through ArduSub a open source software system, enabling autonomous pathing and real time control.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
