730 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 382 0 R
/E (Instead of the traditional method of separating horizontal and vertical extension, our two extension systems are integrated, with the horizontal extension mounted onto the vertical slides with a side plate. Tested through finite element analysis simulations, we settled on a geometry that can withstand the motions of the linear rail. As shown in strain analysis, with extra bracing and support the side plate withstands force much better at the tip. All servos are concentratately placed for the best center of mass and sub-system rigidness. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [46]
>>
endobj
