/P 384 0 R
/E (For autonomous control of the robot, we chose to use the PedroPathing Motion Library. This library uses a 3 odometry pod localization system, which allows for the robot to follow predefined paths. We use a pathing system rather than individual move commands because it allows for more efficient movements to save time and allow for higher scoring autos.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [12]
>>
