/Title (Participating in FTC challenges us to think critically and work collaboratively, pushing the boundaries of what we can achieve together. Our journey is not just about building robots; it's about fostering the leaders, thinkers, and innovators of tomorrow. We are committed to upholding the principles of FIRST, adhering to and promoting gracious professionalism, teamwork, and the pursuit of excellence in all our endeavors. For us, FIRST is not just a learning process; it's about building a community united by the shared goal of making a positive impact on the world through science and technology.)
