/Title (Our flow chart for the teleoperated control period demonstrates our automations within driver control. We have developed a simple control system that automates as many processes as possible, while giving the driver sufficient room for error.  The code consists of 3 different states controlled via a state machine. An intaking state, an idle state, and a scoring state. Benefiting from our multi-threaded driver control, switching between these states automatically manipulates the sample/specimen from ground to scoring position, avoiding collisions and rotating the specimen for scoring. Toggle positions within each state allows for repeatability and consistency.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1986 0 R
>>
endobj
